{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01RYc7WRbEb9AkezC8g7sj32","type":"tool_result","content":"for kind in MISSING DIFFERS NOEXEC; do\n  n=$(grep -c \"^$kind \" \"$TMP/compare.log\")\n  [ \"$n\" -eq 0 ] && ok \"$kind: 0 of $(sed -n 's/^TOTAL //p' \"$TMP/compare.log\")\" \\\n    || fail \"$kind: $n — $(grep \"^$kind \" \"$TMP/compare.log\" | head -5 | cut -d' ' -f2 | tr '\\n' ' ')\"\ndone\n\necho \"== user edits survive ==\"\ngrep -qx 'rc-upgrade marker' \"$TPL/extensions/rc-upgrade-marker.md\" && ok \"own extension kept\" || fail \"own extension lost\"\ngrep -qx 'rc_upgrade_marker: true' \"$TPL/params.yaml\" && ok \"own parameter kept\" || fail \"own parameter lost\"\n\necho \"== second run changes nothing ==\"\nrc=0\n(cd \"$TPL\" && IWE_UPDATE_CHANNEL=rc bash update.sh --yes) > \"$TMP/update2.log\" 2>&1 || rc=$?\n[ \"$rc\" -eq 0 ] && grep -q 'Всё актуально' \"$TMP/update2.log\" && ok \"second run: nothing to update\" \\\n  || { tail -15 \"$TMP/update2.log\"; fail \"second run exit $rc without «Всё актуально»\"; }\n\necho\nif [ \"$FAILS\" -gt 0 ]; then\n  echo \"FAILED: $FAILS check(s) — upgrade $PREV_TAG -> $RC_TAG\"\n  exit 1\nfi\necho \"PASS: upgrade $PREV_TAG -> $RC_TAG\"\n71:# issue #863: release commit SHA, set by resolve_delivery_ref for rollback detection.\n1072:# ordered by git (rollback_by_version, #963).\n1214:# rollback_by_version — issue #963: when the installed copy and the release share no commit\n1217:# against UPSTREAM_VERSION (set in Step 1, before the rollback check runs).\n1218:# Exit codes (the same contract as detect_release_rollback):\n1219:#   0 - the release is strictly older than the installed version: a rollback\n1220:#   1 - the release is newer or equal (equal versions do not prove a rollback)\n1223:rollback_by_version() {\n1233:# rollback_without_release_commit — issue #1411: the release commit is neither in the local\n1237:# HEAD, so ancestry cannot show a rollback; order by manifest version instead.